# Generated audio and rendered video stay out of the repository. Both are
# reproducible — narration with `tts.mjs`, the films with `record.mjs` /
# `intro.mjs` — and neither belongs in a git history as binary churn.
#
# Regenerating narration costs API credits, so keep local copies; they are
# ignored, not disposable.
vo/beats/
vo/samples/
vo/*.wav
vo/*.mp3
